[{"answer":"Okay. What would you like to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm new to this area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so perhaps you could tell me something about the park first, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Altogether the park covers 170 acres,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"that's 69 hectares.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There are three main types of habitat:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"wetland, grassland and woodland.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The woods are well established and varied,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"with an oak plantation, and other areas of mixed species.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The wetland is quite varied, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The original farmland was dug up around 40 years ago to extract gravel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Once this work was completed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"the gravel pits filled with water, forming the two large lakes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also several smaller ones, ponds and a stream that flows through the park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so I suppose with these different habitats there's quite a variety of wildlife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There certainly is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of different species of birds and insects,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and also animals like deer and rabbits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And I understand you organise educational visits for school parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"We can organise a wide range of activities and adapt them to suit all ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give me some examples of the activities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, one focus is on science,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"where we help children to discover and study plants, trees and insects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They also collect and analyse data about the things they see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Another focus is on geography.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The park is a great environment to learn and practise reading a map","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and using a compass to navigate around the park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you do anything connected with history?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"For instance, the children can explore how the use of the land has changed over time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's leisure and tourism.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That focuses on your visitors, I would imagine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, mostly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The children find out about them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"their requirements, the problems they may cause and how we manage these.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And another subject we cover is music:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"here the children experiment with natural materials to create sounds","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and explore rhythm and tempo.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That must be fun!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Most children really enjoy it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, all the activities are educational, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Learning outside the classroom encourages children to be creative,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and to explore and discover for themselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I would imagine they get a sense of freedom that might not be a normal part of their lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And very often the children discover that they can do things they didn't know they could do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and they develop new skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"This gives them greater self-confidence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what about the practical side of it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"How much does it cost for a full-day visit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"We would expect to bring between 30 and 40 children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"If there are over 30,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"it costs £4.95 for each child who attends on the day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"We invoice you afterwards,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so you don't pay for children who can't come because of sickness, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There's no charge for leaders and other adults - as many as you want to bring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds very fair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks for all the information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need to discuss it with my colleagues,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I hope to get back to you soon to make a booking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll look forward to hearing from you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye, and thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-1-2024-06-29-10-03-27/67_v3.mp3"}]
